                                "sense_id": "0e0a1629-b40b-3c3e-a8e6-a95a7a893678",
                                "text": "The schemes, the threats, the feuds. The hot nastiness that prevails over everything and everyone. In this idiot and stillborn-stricken village the bereaved sneer at the barren and the barren laugh at the burdened, and the nights are amutter with the rehearsal of nested blames and intractable vendettas."
